    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1202f09a9077e810234b7605",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄自幼便热爱阅读。她崇拜故事中的英雄，\n然而却自认个性胆怯不够格当英雄，\n因此放弃了这个梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13bdbe8d1186941b7fba2c646a626b2607d76959a17a47c9c60b983fc1d4bc70",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0b8263d3d76cc00b95873d9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄传说",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e4953a8adb23b00064ed92298a98ec0875d81773561eb95f148a63b8bd7a22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afc66bb7d6d4235bcb260e4b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "直到在年幼赛马娘赛跑中获得优胜。\n她发觉若站上赛场或许就有希望成为英雄──\n这篇故事也随之展开。",
      "source_fingerprint": "871ed3e903babb64dbe4b23e61ad2e62f23a0bc82c0d435eac1bd1e6074e66dd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b0baf9ba7fd113bb46f54bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄传说",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e4953a8adb23b00064ed92298a98ec0875d81773561eb95f148a63b8bd7a22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77cfc602e617929a5a3bd9f6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所谓英雄就是要达成壮举、吸引众人目光。\n为求在闪耀系列赛缔造成果……\n她开始日夜勤于锻炼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c87ec3e25e97c45a72d44fa5d6f62ba5c3c06b0526e0e727d7112f6d511908d5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ba111c44458a2f1a37b24f7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄传说",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e4953a8adb23b00064ed92298a98ec0875d81773561eb95f148a63b8bd7a22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047400.json",
      "json_path": [
