    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03480620514a69126a761190",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄接受采访。\n不过她却不敢说出“想成为英雄”这个梦想。\n她担心说出远大的目标会被嘲笑不自量力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f79359beb6662d735d3deab63293185f6a57554de1925167ae21a3f48161020",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e745be19b648bc6492863b5a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄传说",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e4953a8adb23b00064ed92298a98ec0875d81773561eb95f148a63b8bd7a22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:028ffad699363fd40eb9da34",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "另一方面，\n吉兆却大方地说出目标是称霸德比。\n荒漠英雄对她投向羡慕的目光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bd0388ff0262e74fa588409cce4b676cb6f7c3c7f22c8aad87116bb19d52231",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
