    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3287a5d9ada6d68fa1922720",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄传说",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e4953a8adb23b00064ed92298a98ec0875d81773561eb95f148a63b8bd7a22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d21fe6e7ab7d07f9188b18d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而……跟着对方一同训练后她才发现。\n那份强悍是以从不懈怠的努力\n与坚不可摧的意志打造而成的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dea1134f7d75a7dc44360a5385a816835aa21e9e77028ce51b09ffbc71d66d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047401.json",
      "json_path": [
