    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c25f1bf618da0a4de750fb19",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吉兆的眼神仿佛一把宝剑。\n那刀锋丝毫没有一丝阴影，\n仿佛在朝阳中闪闪发光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bd0320a3c030b931048f02e3179611a44fef9174463d71bf9b19caf65d0d065",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
