    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:327d9fa05489f7c1ec62e63b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄下定决心\n要全力以赴得到属于自己的那把剑。\n她变得更加投入于训练了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "949af73b4b66daa1559c874b5c93fc8d2f8ca87381ccce17a894324beb6c5dff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
